    ('<li><strong><code>[363]</code></strong> Agache, A., Brooker, M., Florescu, A., Iordache, A., Liguori, A., Neugebauer, R., Piwonka, P. et Popa, D.-M. (2020). Firecracker: Lightweight Virtualization for Serverless Applications. 17th USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation (NSDI \'20), p. 419-434. Même source que [360]. <a href="https://www.usenix.org/system/files/nsdi20-paper-agache.pdf"><code>https://www.usenix.org/system/files/nsdi20-paper-agache.pdf</code></a></li>', '<li><strong><code>[363]</code></strong> Agache, A., Brooker, M., Florescu, A., Iordache, A., Liguori, A., Neugebauer, R., Piwonka, P. et Popa, D.-M. (2020). Firecracker: Lightweight Virtualization for Serverless Applications (fiche et mémoire NSDI \'20). 17th USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation (NSDI \'20), p. 419-434. Même source que [360]. <a href="https://www.usenix.org/conference/nsdi20/presentation/agache"><code>https://www.usenix.org/conference/nsdi20/presentation/agache</code></a></li>', 'REF-363-url-titre'),
